# Typed Contracts

- Model business objects with explicit types; no `any` or loosely-shaped JSON crossing a service boundary.
- All inter-service communication uses DTOs from the shared, versioned `contracts` package. Do not redefine boundary types locally.
- Validate payloads at each boundary at runtime (e.g. Zod/TypeBox), not just at compile time.
- A DTO change is a contract change: bump the contracts version and flag it for review.
